[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5709.43, "timestamp": "01:35:09", "text": "去，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5712.149, "timestamp": "01:35:12", "text": "沒關係，我們做點什麼，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5719.51, "timestamp": "01:35:19", "text": "我們試著用這個造個句子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5722.87, "timestamp": "01:35:22", "text": "。好的，我就口語敘述一下。我確定它會100%錯誤。文法使用很差，但我會嘗試"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5727.91, "timestamp": "01:35:27", "text": "。好的。嗨。呃，okusa。嗨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5730.31, "timestamp": "01:35:30", "text": "我們用那個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5740.79, "timestamp": "01:35:40", "text": "造個句子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5744.07, "timestamp": "01:35:44", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5747.83, "timestamp": "01:35:47", "text": "句子。不。等等。那個「mance bun」是什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5750.39, "timestamp": "01:35:50", "text": "？嗨，等等，不要。為什麼我覺得不對勁？夥計，等等。什麼？我有個主意。我有個主意。"}]